<title>BRAZIL: Lloyds Bank Brazil names new asset management head.</title>
<headline>Lloyds Bank Brazil names new asset management head.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lloyds Bank Brazil unit said Walter Brasil was hired to head the Lloyds Asset Management.</p>
<p>Brasil, who will take up his position on January 27, had been working for local private bank Banco Real de Investimento, Lloyds Bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>Lloyds Asset Management was created in October last year in partnership with local bank Banco Multiplic to focus on asset management, investment strategy and risk management.</p>
<p>Its main clients include pension funds and foreign investors.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
